text SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_2F_Text_DraconidRepScientist2Uniform {
    format("Strange that a heavy iron ship floats, isn't it? It's called buoyancy.\p"
           "TEAM MAGMA wants to shrink the sea. Then what would our ships float on?")
